OL,3,AStrictly returns with new hosting trio
OL,4,Aas celebrities find out dance pairings
OL,5,
OL,6,FStrictly Come Dancing has returned to
OL,7,Fthe small screen for its 24th series,
OL,8,Fin a new era for the show as it moves
OL,9,Fforward with a revamped presenting line
OL,10,Fup.
OL,12,FBroadcaster Emma Willis, comedian Josh
OL,13,FWiddicombe and former Strictly
OL,14,Fprofessional Johannes Radebe made their
OL,15,Fpresenting debut on Saturday, taking
OL,16,Fover from long-running hosting duo Tess
OL,17,FDaly and Claudia Winkleman, who left
OL,18,Fthe show last year.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
